  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a <strong>Bonus Action</strong>, you can leap up to <strong>30 feet</strong> to an unoccupied space you can see. When you land, each hostile creature within 5 feet of your landing space takes kinetic damage equal to your <strong>Strength modifier</strong>.</p><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your <strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong>, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</p>"
